# Webhook that receives the quote form and creator applications as JSON (POST).
# Point it at an n8n Webhook node; set that node's "Allowed Origins (CORS)" to the site's domain.
# Every payload has a `form` field: "quote-request" or "creator-application".
# Note: VITE_ variables are embedded in the public bundle, so validate and rate-limit in n8n.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=""
